 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 506966,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>Identify <span data-math=\"{a_1}\">{a_1}</span> and <span data-math=\"d\">d</span> for the following arithmetic sequence. Use this information to determine the <span data-math=\"86\\text{th}\">86\\text{th}</span> term.</p>\n<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ {4.5,8.1,11.7,15.3,18.9,22.5,26.1,...} \\right\\}\">\\left\\{ {4.5,8.1,11.7,15.3,18.9,22.5,26.1,...} \\right\\}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>The term <span data-math=\"{a_1}\"></span> is the first term in a sequence. In this sequence, <span data-math=\"{a_1} = 4.5\"></span>.</p>\n<p>The term, <span data-math=\"d\"></span>, represents the constant difference. Subtract the first term from the second term.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"8.1-4.5 = 3.6\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"d = 3.6\"></span></p>\n<p>You can find any term by using the formula: <span data-math=\"{a_i} = {a_1} + d \\times \\left({i - 1} \\right)\"></span>.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"{a_{86}} = 4.5 + 3.6 \\times \\left({86 - 1} \\right) = 4.5 + 3.6(85) = 310.5\"></span></p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "<span data-math=\"{a_1} = 4.5\">{a_1} = 4.5</span>, <span data-math=\"d = 3.6\">d = 3.6</span>, <span data-math=\"{a_{36}} = 310.5\">{a_{36}} = 310.5</span>"
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
